{
    "_comment": [
        "SHARED test vectors for the Solar Hijri engine.",
        "Read by BOTH the PHP suite (tests/Feature/Calendar/SolarHijriVectorsTest.php)",
        "and the TypeScript suite (resources/js/lib/solar-hijri.test.ts), so the two",
        "implementations are proven to agree rather than assumed to.",
        "",
        "Every Gregorian figure in this file was produced by ICU's persian calendar",
        "through Intl.DateTimeFormat -- an implementation with no code in common with",
        "this one -- and then cross-checked in the opposite direction before being",
        "written. The leap-year and month-length columns were derived from the",
        "33-year rule the engine implements, so a rule that is wrong in one place is",
        "wrong in both and the tests catch it."
    ],
